{#
tasks/index.html.twig — the tasks at full size: the mailbox with the Tasks pane
at full width (#755).

What a phone gets from the drawer and what a middle click gets anywhere.
`fullPane` is the whole difference from a workspace with the pane at full width:
it is drawn that way whatever this device remembers, and borrowed for the visit
when the workspace does not show the tasks at all. No list is rendered behind
it, and it is said to be empty, so leaving full width here is a visit to the
mail (layout--workspace's `page` value).
#}
{% extends '_layout/_mailbox.html.twig' %}

{% set fullPane = 'tasks' %}

{% block title %}{{ 'tasks.title'|trans }}{% endblock %}
{% block message_list %}{% endblock %}
{% block inbox_tabs %}{% endblock %}
{% block list_rendered %}0{% endblock %}

{% block tasks_pane_body %}
    {% include 'tasks/_pane_frame.html.twig' %}
{% endblock %}
